; A posting in an ordinary transaction is checked under --strict and
; --pedantic whatever its account name contains: only automated and
; periodic transaction templates may name an account with $name or
; %(expr), which is resolved when the template is applied.

commodity $
account Assets:Checking

2024/01/01 Store
    Expenses:$food    $10.00
    Expenses:%(x)     $5.00
    Assets:Checking

test bal --strict
             $-15.00  Assets:Checking
              $15.00  Expenses
              $10.00    $food
               $5.00    %(x)
--------------------
                   0
__ERROR__
Warning: "$FILE", line 10: Unknown account 'Expenses:$food'
Warning: "$FILE", line 11: Unknown account 'Expenses:%(x)'
end test

test bal --pedantic -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 10:
While parsing posting:
  Expenses:$food    $10.00

Error: Unknown account 'Expenses:$food'
end test
